OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOrkney may have a cloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp start but brightening up through
OL,7,Fthe morning. Otherwise often cloudy
OL,8,Fwith some scattered showers, although
OL,9,Fthese will be more frequent for
OL,10,FShetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers continuing through
OL,13,Fthe evening in fresh northeasterly
OL,14,Fwinds, a few clear spells developing
OL,15,Fduring the night but feeling chilly.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA breezy day with blustery
OL,18,Fshowers, perhaps turning into longer
OL,19,Fspells of rain, becoming brighter and
OL,20,Fdrier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
