OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Fon the cool side but a lot of bright
OL,7,Fweather for the weekend with
OL,8,Foccasional showers, perhaps cloudier
OL,9,Fon Sunday.
